  title: 'Self-Government and Autonomy Under the PAP 1959 '
  info: "Singapore achieves full self-governance under the British Commonwealth,
    with the People\u2019s Action Party (PAP), led by Lee Kuan Yew, winning a landslide
    victory in the elections. Lee becomes Singapore\u2019s first Prime Minister,
    introducing sweeping reforms to tackle unemployment, poverty, and inadequate
    housing. Policies to promote education, healthcare, and industrialization lay
    the groundwork for Singapore\u2019s transformation into a modern city-state.  "
